            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amwĩa, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Nĩkwĩthĩwa nũleketye mũndũ ũla nĩvathĩte anangwe vyũ auma kw’okonĩ kwaku, kwondũ wa ũu thayũ waku ũkeethĩwa vandũ va thayũ wake, na andũ maku vandũ va andũ make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli aenda nyũmbanĩ yake atakinyĩkya na e na woo, na avika Samalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
